<</Title<FEFF00460065006C00690070006500200053006F00740069006C006C006500202014002000540065006300680020004C006500610064002000B7002000530065006E0069006F007200200053006F00660074007700610072006500200045006E00670069006E006500650072>/Subject(Hands-on Tech Lead across finance, payments and media. Led the backend team at Eleven Sports reporting to the CTO, served as Scrum Master and squad specialist at SWIFT, and now coaches 5+ squads on secure, automated delivery. I stay in the code: microservices migrations, event-driven platforms, CI/CD blueprints and database migrations at the billion-record scale.)/Keywords<>/Author(Felipe Sotille)/Creator(Typst 0.15.0)/ModDate(D:20261001085014Z)/CreationDate(D:20261001085014Z)>>
